@startuml

title RL Supervisor - Class Diagram

package "Supervisor" as SupervisorPackage {
    class TrainingOrchestrator
    class EvaluationOrchestrator
    class PendingAction <<dataType>>

    note as TrainingOrchestratorNote
        Coordinates accepted actions and completed transitions across independent interaction streams.
        Triggers run-relative training updates when the learning agent reports that enough experience is available.
        Coordinates periodic and final checkpoint persistence for the current training run.
        Controls the main loop and reliable environment shutdown.
    end note
    TrainingOrchestrator .. TrainingOrchestratorNote

    note as EvaluationOrchestratorNote
        Selects deterministic actions for independent environment streams using a loaded checkpoint.
        Accumulates rewards for accepted actions and records statistics when an episode completes.
        Resets terminal streams and optionally stops after the completed-episode threshold is reached.
        Performs no PPO training and reliably stops the environment when the run ends.
    end note
    EvaluationOrchestrator .. EvaluationOrchestratorNote

    note as PendingActionNote
        Represents an action whose environment result is still pending.
        Preserves the context required to create a complete Transition when that result becomes available.
    end note
    PendingAction .. PendingActionNote
}

package "Environment" as EnvironmentPackage {
    interface IEnvironment <<interface>>
    class EnvironmentStep <<dataType>>

    note as IEnvironmentNote
        Defines the simulation-independent contract used by the supervisor.
        Accepts actions for independent interaction streams and advances the environment.
        Returns step results and resets individual streams.
        Reports whether the environment is running and allows it to be stopped.
    end note
    IEnvironment .. IEnvironmentNote

    note as EnvironmentStepNote
        Carries the result of one environment interaction.
        Provides an implementation-independent result format shared between the environment and the supervisor.
        May include an opaque identifier describing why an episode ended.
    end note
    EnvironmentStep .. EnvironmentStepNote
}

package "Webots Environment" as WebotsEnvironmentPackage {
    class WebotsEnv
    class ZumoRobot
    class StartPose <<dataType>>
    class StartPoseSelector
    enum _RobotInteractionState

    note as WebotsEnvNote
        Adapts the Webots simulation to the environment contract.
        Manages the simulation clock and the collection of robots.
        Routes actions and resets to the correct robot.
        Collects completed step results and reports when the simulation ends.
    end note
    WebotsEnv .. WebotsEnvNote

    note as ZumoRobotNote
        Represents one robot and its current episode state.
        Receives observations and status updates through callbacks.
        Applies actions through the transport layer.
        Uses the RewardCalculator to calculate rewards and determine whether an episode is complete.
        Combines previous and current normalized sensor values into each observation.
        Resets its robot and episode state when requested.
    end note
    ZumoRobot .. ZumoRobotNote

    note as StartPoseNote
        Defines one configured Webots reset pose.
        Carries translation, axis-angle rotation, and optional relative lateral and rotational offset ranges used when repositioning a robot.
    end note
    StartPose .. StartPoseNote

    note as StartPoseSelectorNote
        Selects the next configured robot reset pose.
        Supports sequential, random, and randomized-offset strategies without coupling selection policy to ZumoRobot.
        Optional seeds make both random strategies reproducible.
    end note
    StartPoseSelector .. StartPoseSelectorNote

    note as RobotInteractionStateNote
        Identifies the asynchronous interaction phase of one robot stream.
    end note
    _RobotInteractionState .. RobotInteractionStateNote
}

package "Reward" as RewardPackage {
    class RewardCalculator
    class RewardContext <<dataType>>
    enum EpisodeTerminationReason

    note as RewardCalculatorNote
        Selects a configured reward function by its stable identifier.
        Calculates the learning reward from the current RewardContext.
        Applies the fixed configured thresholds that determine whether the episode is terminal.
        Reports the reason when a terminal condition is reached.
    end note
    RewardCalculator .. RewardCalculatorNote

    note as RewardContextNote
        Carries the raw sensor values and current episode information required for one reward and terminal evaluation.
        Provides one immutable input for reward calculation and terminal-condition evaluation.
    end note
    RewardContext .. RewardContextNote

    note as EpisodeTerminationReasonNote
        Names the finish-line and lost-line causes of a completed robot episode.
        These identifiers are passed through the generic environment contract as strings.
    end note
    EpisodeTerminationReason .. EpisodeTerminationReasonNote
}

package "Transport" as TransportPackage {
    class ZumoSerial

    enum CommandId
    enum RobotStatus

    note as ZumoSerialNote
        Provides the transport connection used by ZumoRobot.
        Processes incoming messages and forwards sensor and status data through callbacks.
        Sends motor-speed updates and other control commands.
        Keeps communication details separate from robot behavior.
    end note
    ZumoSerial .. ZumoSerialNote

    note as CommandIdNote
        Identifies a control command accepted by the transport connection.
        Provides named values for command selection.
    end note
    CommandId .. CommandIdNote

    note as RobotStatusNote
        Represents the status reported through the transport connection.
        Distinguishes normal operation from an error state.
    end note
    RobotStatus .. RobotStatusNote
}

package "Agent" as AgentPackage {
    class PPOAgent
    class AgentUpdateResult <<dataType>>

    note as PPOAgentNote
        Selects an action for each observation and returns it together with the information required for learning.
        Provides deterministic action selection for checkpoint evaluation.
        Passes transitions to Memory and checks whether enough experience is available.
        Coordinates training using rollout data prepared by Memory and updates Models.
        Reports training results and can save or restore the learned models.
    end note
    PPOAgent .. PPOAgentNote

    note as AgentUpdateResultNote
        Represents the result of a completed training update.
        Provides aggregate policy and Critic losses, PPO diagnostics, final rollout KL, policy early-stop and adaptation information, explained variance, the current exploration level, and the transition count required to create TrainingMetrics.
    end note
    AgentUpdateResult .. AgentUpdateResultNote
}

package "Trajectory Buffer" as TrajectoryBufferPackage {
    class Memory
    class Transition <<dataType>>
    class EpisodeStatistics <<dataType>>
    class TrainingBatch <<dataType>>

    note as MemoryNote
        Stores transitions separately for each interaction stream.
        Validates their order and determines when enough experience is available for training.
        Calculates returns and advantages from the stored rollout data.
        Combines, shuffles, and batches the prepared training data.
        Provides statistics for completed episodes and allows collected experience to be cleared explicitly.
    end note
    Memory .. MemoryNote

    note as TransitionNote
        Represents one completed interaction used for learning.
        Combines the observation and selected action with the associated learning information and resulting environment feedback.
        Preserves the episode and step context so that Memory can order experiences and derive the episode statistics used for logging.
    end note
    Transition .. TransitionNote

    note as EpisodeStatisticsNote
        Summarizes rewards and lengths for completed episodes in the collected learning experience.
    end note
    EpisodeStatistics .. EpisodeStatisticsNote

    note as TrainingBatchNote
        Represents a prepared batch of learning data consumed during model training.
    end note
    TrainingBatch .. TrainingBatchNote
}

package "Networks" as NetworksPackage {
    class Models
    class TrainableStdDev
    class ActionResult <<dataType>>
    class PolicyOptimizationMetrics <<dataType>>
    class CriticOptimizationMetrics <<dataType>>

    note as ActionResultNote
        Represents the model output produced when selecting an action for one observation.
        Carries the selected action and the additional information needed to create a Transition.
        Provides the information used to create action diagnostics.
    end note
    ActionResult .. ActionResultNote

    note as ModelsNote
        Owns the actor and critic neural networks and the trainable exploration variability.
        Provides the model calculations used to select actions and estimate observation values.
        Guards policy updates by a KL limit, completes Critic updates, and evaluates final rollout KL.
        Adapts the shared policy learning rates and reports the resulting optimization diagnostics.
    end note
    Models .. ModelsNote

    note as TrainableStdDevNote
        Maintains and constrains the trainable standard deviation used for exploration during action selection.
    end note
    TrainableStdDev .. TrainableStdDevNote

    note as PolicyOptimizationMetricsNote
        Reports actor loss, approximate KL, clip fraction, and sample count for one checked policy batch.
        Records whether that batch's policy gradients were applied.
    end note
    PolicyOptimizationMetrics .. PolicyOptimizationMetricsNote

    note as CriticOptimizationMetricsNote
        Reports critic loss and sample count for one applied Critic batch.
    end note
    CriticOptimizationMetrics .. CriticOptimizationMetricsNote
}

package "Training Logger" as TrainingLoggerPackage {
    class ActionDiagnostics <<dataType>>
    class TrainingLogger
    class TrainingMetrics <<dataType>>
    class CheckpointReference <<dataType>>

    note as ActionDiagnosticsNote
        Represents diagnostic information for one selected action.
    end note
    ActionDiagnostics .. ActionDiagnosticsNote

    note as TrainingLoggerNote
        Defines training metrics and action diagnostics, records checkpoint provenance, and persists them together with the run configuration.
    end note
    TrainingLogger .. TrainingLoggerNote

    note as TrainingMetricsNote
        Combines the model-update results with available completed-episode statistics.
        Represents the learning progress and exploration state after one training update.
        Provides the complete information required by TrainingLogger to record the update.
    end note
    TrainingMetrics .. TrainingMetricsNote

    note as CheckpointReferenceNote
        Identifies one checkpoint and the earlier training-run lineage from which it was derived.
    end note
    CheckpointReference .. CheckpointReferenceNote
}

package "Evaluation Logger" as EvaluationLoggerPackage {
    class EvaluationLogger
    class EpisodeEvaluation <<dataType>>

    note as EvaluationLoggerNote
        Writes one CSV record for each completed evaluation episode.
        Persists the effective run configuration and source checkpoint path.
        Writes overall and per-stream reward, action-count, and termination-reason statistics when closed.
    end note
    EvaluationLogger .. EvaluationLoggerNote

    note as EpisodeEvaluationNote
        Contains the results of one completed episode in one environment stream.
        Combines total reward, action count, per-action reward statistics, and an optional termination reason.
    end note
    EpisodeEvaluation .. EpisodeEvaluationNote
}

SupervisorPackage -[hidden]down-> AgentPackage

EnvironmentPackage -[hidden]right-> AgentPackage
AgentPackage -[hidden]right-> TrainingLoggerPackage
TrainingLoggerPackage -[hidden]down-> EvaluationLoggerPackage

EnvironmentPackage -[hidden]down-> WebotsEnvironmentPackage
AgentPackage -[hidden]down-> TrajectoryBufferPackage
TrainingLoggerPackage -[hidden]down-> NetworksPackage

WebotsEnvironmentPackage -[hidden]right-> TrajectoryBufferPackage
TrajectoryBufferPackage -[hidden]right-> NetworksPackage

WebotsEnvironmentPackage -[hidden]down-> RewardPackage
TrajectoryBufferPackage -[hidden]down-> TransportPackage
RewardPackage -[hidden]right-> TransportPackage

TrainingOrchestrator o--> IEnvironment
TrainingOrchestrator o--> PPOAgent
TrainingOrchestrator o--> TrainingLogger
EvaluationOrchestrator o--> IEnvironment
EvaluationOrchestrator o--> PPOAgent
EvaluationOrchestrator o--> EvaluationLogger

IEnvironment <|.. WebotsEnv

WebotsEnv "1" *--> "1..*" ZumoRobot
ZumoRobot *--> ZumoSerial
ZumoRobot *--> RewardCalculator
ZumoRobot *--> StartPoseSelector

PPOAgent *--> Memory
PPOAgent *--> Models
Models *--> TrainableStdDev

@enduml
